    </promptVersions>
    <promptVersions>
        <body>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;em&gt;New Contact&lt;/em&gt; page opens.&amp;nbsp;Enter as much business-relevant information as you can about your new contact. Minimum&amp;nbsp;requirements for a contact are &lt;strong&gt;First Name&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Last&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Name&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</body>
